TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:Run 3 mi: Easy run + strides
DESCRIPTION:Easy 3 mi + 4x20s strides\nPurpose of week: Re-entry: easy mile
 s and strides to confirm the foot\, back and legs tolerate running again. 
 Saturday run paused for sore legs.\nPhase: Recover from the NYC Marathon D
 NF and\, on your doctor's advice\, ramp up very slowly through December\, 
 with long runs capped at 9 miles until 2027. Weeks 3-6 are a focused 10K b
 uild (threshold\, sub-threshold and race-pace work) for the Boca 10K on De
 c 27. Reassess in January.\nPace: Easy 9:40-10:30\; strides ~7:20 (20s)\nS
 hoe: Clifton Pro\nWeek 1\, 1 Recovery & slow ramp\, 15 mi total\nNote: Eas
 y runs plus strides (relaxed\, 20 s). Check urine color\, lateral foot\, l
 ow back (<=2/10). Saturday run paused while legs recover (strength only).
END:VEVENT
