SUMMARY:Run 5 mi: Threshold
DESCRIPTION:LT: 1.5 WU\, 2x8' @ LT\, 2' jog\, 1 CD\nPurpose of week: 10K bu
 ild\, threshold week: a first LT session (2x8') plus sub-threshold Thursda
 y raise the engine that 10K pace sits on.\nPhase: Recover from the NYC Mar
 athon DNF and\, on your doctor's advice\, ramp up very slowly through Dece
 mber\, with long runs capped at 9 miles until 2027. Weeks 3-6 are a focuse
 d 10K build (threshold\, sub-threshold and race-pace work) for the Boca 10
 K on Dec 27. Reassess in January.\nPace: LT ~7:50/mi (HR ~162-166)\; WU/CD
  easy 9:40-10:30\nShoe: Mach X 3\nWeek 3\, 1 Recovery & slow ramp\, 18.5 m
 i total\nNote: 10K build\, threshold week: LT Tuesday (HR 162-166)\, sub-t
 hreshold Thursday. Everything else easy. Skip the Thursday session if Tues
 day leaves you flat.
END:VEVENT
