 ast big stimulus before the race.\nPhase: Recover from the NYC Marathon DN
 F and\, on your doctor's advice\, ramp up very slowly through December\, w
 ith long runs capped at 9 miles until 2027. Weeks 3-6 are a focused 10K bu
 ild (threshold\, sub-threshold and race-pace work) for the Boca 10K on Dec
  27. Reassess in January.\nPace: LT ~7:50/mi (HR ~162-166)\; WU/CD easy 9:
 40-10:30\nShoe: Mach X 3\nWeek 5\, 1 Recovery & slow ramp\, 21 mi total\nN
 ote: 10K build\, peak week: biggest threshold session Tuesday\, 800s at ra
 ce pace Thursday. If HR runs high at 8:00 on Thursday\, the race goal is 8
 :05\, not 7:50.
END:VEVENT
